Z||000006||Songman||04-24-2001||07:06 PM||||I do like that dash though! It just looks to me like a GP has a lot more curved dash... but then, I guess no one said it would be a direct bolt in.<P>I just got rid of a Dodge Daytona. One thing that was in that dash that I would love to incorporate into my new one was the pull out cup holder. Only takes about an inch of space vertically, but man what a great thing to have! I'd almost install a single DIN radio just to have that!<P>And I want a real glove compartment!<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif">  <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A><p>[This message has been edited by Songman (edited 04-24-2001).]||||reg||1
